# ---- editing-pass backup litter (added 2026-09-20) --------------------------------------------
# MEASURED: `git status` held 333 entries; 326 were backup copies (44.5 MB) left by earlier edit
# passes, and only TWO were real modified source. One of those two was ggml/CMakeLists.txt with
# 190 lines of verified work that existed nowhere but the working tree -- it was invisible in the
# noise. These patterns exist so `git status` can be read at a glance; they are suffixes APPENDED
# to a real filename, and no tracked file in this tree matches any of them (checked before adding).
*.*.pre-*
*-backup
*.bak
*.bak.*
*.bak_*
*.orig
*.rej
*.old
*.notlanded
*.rejected
NUL.obj
